     k8-fr-dispatch-stalls
             (Event D1H) Count all dispatch stalls.

     k8-fr-fpu-exceptions [,mask=_q_u_a_l_i_f_i_e_r]
             (Event DBH) Count FPU exceptions.  This event is supported in re‐
             vision B and later CPUs.  This event may be further qualified us‐
             ing _q_u_a_l_i_f_i_e_r, which is a ‘+’ separated set of the following key‐
             words:

             sse-and-x87-microtraps
